fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266SPSRangeExtensionParams","fragment":"\n\tGstH266SPSRangeExtensionParams\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266SPSRangeExtensionParams\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266SPSRangeExtensionParams\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 SPS range extension parameters.\nspecifies whether an extended dynamic range is\nused for transform coefficients.\nspecifies whether\nsh_ts_residual_coding_rice_idx_minus1 may be present in slice_header\nsyntax structures referring to the SPS.\nspecifies whether an alternative Rice parameter\nderivation is used.\nspecifies whether Rice parameter\nderivation is initialized at the start of each TU using statistics\naccumulated from previous TUs.\nspecifies whether\nsh_reverse_last_sig_coeff_flag is present in slice_header syntax\nstructures referring to the SPS.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 SPS range extension parameters.\nspecifies whether an extended dynamic range is\nused for transform coefficients.\nspecifies whether\nsh_ts_residual_coding_rice_idx_minus1 may be present in slice_header\nsyntax structures referring to the SPS.\nspecifies whether an alternative Rice parameter\nderivation is used.\nspecifies whether Rice parameter\nderivation is initialized at the start of each TU using statistics\naccumulated from previous TUs.\nspecifies whether\nsh_reverse_last_sig_coeff_flag is present in slice_header syntax\nstructures referring to the SPS.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 SPS range extension parameters.\nspecifies whether an extended dynamic range is\nused for transform coefficients.\nspecifies whether\nsh_ts_residual_coding_rice_idx_minus1 may be present in slice_header\nsyntax structures referring to the SPS.\nspecifies whether an alternative Rice parameter\nderivation is used.\nspecifies whether Rice parameter\nderivation is initialized at the start of each TU using statistics\naccumulated from previous TUs.\nspecifies whether\nsh_reverse_last_sig_coeff_flag is present in slice_header syntax\nstructures referring to the SPS.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});